# Runs prettier, eslint --fix and related Jest tests over STAGED files only.
#
# This hook used to be commented out with the note "Commented out for Windows
# development". The .bat sibling that was supposed to cover Windows was never
# reachable: git invokes .husky/pre-commit through sh on every platform,
# including Windows, because Git for Windows ships its own sh. So the hook has
# not run for anyone, on any OS, for as long as it has been disabled.
#
# It is safe to re-enable now: with a real node_modules tree, `pnpm exec`
# resolves lint-staged's bin directly and none of the Yarn PnP shim problems
# that likely prompted the original workaround apply.
pnpm exec lint-staged
